<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 30/ JUNE 2.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 30/ JUNE 2.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, June 2 on Friday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   02.06.97	  30.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5516	    6.5412</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3502	    2.3495</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5744	    4.5686</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4355	    3.4350</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5172	    0.5198</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7793	    0.7787</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2937	    0.2935</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9912	    7.0145</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6934	    0.6935</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2488	    1.2520</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
